      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can\u0027t Get a JNIEnv unless the thread is attached to the VM. AttachCurrentThread is on JavaVM, not JNIEnv.\n\nhttps://docs.oracle.com/javase/7/docs/technotes/guides/jni/spec/invocation.html\n\nThe whole reason this CL exists is that we don\u0027t have a JNIEnv when the thread is not attached to the VM.",
